    "bonus": "10000",
    "reason": "The SKM team was tasked with expanding the active lead pool, accelerating high-tier lead conversion, and driving incremental GMV growth through seller acquisition and incubation in the US market.\nOn the acquisition side, the team activated offline channels via summits and exhibitions, deepened collaboration with clusters, GBS and TSP teams, with TSP channels contributing 54% of new lead coverage. On the incubation side, the team strengthened hero product incubation for strategic key merchants, growing hero SKUs by nearly 60%, expanded coverage of business tools including brand halo measurement, follower coupons and CRM, and deepened penetration of affiliate ISVs. An Engagement Center was established to activate T0-T2 sellers, alongside closer collaboration with GnE and Algo teams to enhance the SKM experience.\nActive leads grew by over 35%, T3+ leads grew by nearly 90%, contributing to 64% of the US market's incremental GMV in H1. SKM user RPR was 2x that of non-SKM users. SKM P0 CCR dropped 20%, AOC dropped 28%, and CSAT improved 7%.",
