    "bonus": "10000",
    "reason": "The DFYD campaign drove both GMV and money efficiency beyond target, with company-version OKR completed at 110% and radical-version at 101%. The H1 company-version GMV target was achieved at 104%, laying a solid foundation for the annual goal. Campaign GMV grew 92% year-over-year, reaching 99% of cumulative target.\nThe campaign delivered record-breaking peaks. On opening day, achievement rate hit 107% with 109% year-over-year growth. A later peak day set a new single-day GMV high for the year, with AB-iGMV surging 21% — a historical peak in US e-commerce — exceeding Black Friday 2025's single-day rate investment high while maintaining stable money efficiency. Throughout the campaign, iROAS consistently stayed above target and market margin remained profitable.\nThe campaign also drove targeted growth across merchant segments and content formats. RIV voucher strategy lifted AOV by 1.85% and AB GMV by 0.74% through improved order conversion and higher high-value transaction share. SKM iGMV grew 19% and FBT merchant iGMV grew 14%, both above market. The DFYD program reached 105% of target, with live broadcast collaboration driving a 22% uplift in the top SLS field.",
